  "description": "A powerful, free, and open-source drag-and-drop email template editor for Blazor applications. Build beautiful responsive email templates with an intuitive visual editor. Features include merge tags with autocomplete, responsive design, rich components, and no CDN dependencies. Perfect for creating marketing emails, newsletters, and transactional emails in your Blazor apps.",
